<section class="platform-flow @(_paused ? "platform-flow--paused" : "")" aria-labelledby="platform-flow-title">
    <header class="platform-flow__heading">
        <div>
            <p class="platform-flow__eyebrow">The connected platform</p>
            <h2 id="platform-flow-title">How SwiftAid comes together</h2>
            <p>From an offline report to a shared understanding. Follow the services that connect people, evidence and action.</p>
        </div>
        <button type="button" class="platform-flow__toggle" aria-pressed="@_paused" @onclick="() => _paused = !_paused">
            @(_paused ? "Play flow" : "Pause flow")
        </button>
    </header>
    <div class="platform-flow__legend" aria-label="Architecture legend">
        <span class="client">People &amp; devices</span><span class="core">Trusted records</span>
        <span class="ai">Conversation &amp; models</span><span class="jobs">Analysis &amp; review</span>
    </div>
    <p class="platform-flow__hint">Follow the arrows. On a small screen, scroll across the diagram to explore every connection.</p>
    <div class="platform-flow__viewport" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="SwiftAid architecture diagram. Scroll horizontally to explore." aria-describedby="platform-flow-note">
        <svg class="platform-flow__diagram" viewBox="0 0 1440 930" role="img" aria-labelledby="architecture-title architecture-description">
            <title id="architecture-title">SwiftAid services and data flow</title>
            <desc id="architecture-description">Web and mobile connect to the Gateway. Application rules authorize PostgreSQL records, private storage and jobs. The PostgreSQL outbox drives Ellai reasoning and tools. Voice uses Muse transcription, Silero and MMS-TTS. Worker processing includes translation, classification and surveillance review. A complete connection list follows this diagram.</desc>
            <defs>
                <marker id="architecture-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto-start-reverse">
                    <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="currentColor" />
                </marker>
            </defs>
            @foreach (var edge in Edges)
            {
                <g class="platform-flow__connection @(edge.Optional ? "platform-flow__connection--optional" : "")">
                    <title>@ConnectionLabel(edge)</title>
                    <path class="platform-flow__edge" d="@edge.Path" marker-end="url(#architecture-arrow)" marker-start="@(edge.Both ? "url(#architecture-arrow)" : null)" />
                    <path class="platform-flow__pulse" d="@edge.Path" />
                </g>
            }
            @foreach (var node in Nodes)
            {
                <g class="platform-flow__node @node.Kind" transform="@($"translate({node.X} {node.Y})")">
                    <title>@node.Title — @node.Detail</title>
                    <rect width="202" height="82" rx="12" />
                    <rect class="platform-flow__accent" x="0" y="17" width="4" height="48" rx="2" />
                    <text x="16" y="30" class="platform-flow__name">@node.Title</text>
                    <text x="16" y="55" class="platform-flow__detail">@node.Detail</text>
                </g>
            }
        </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="platform-flow__footnotes">
        <p><strong>Offline capture, connected intelligence.</strong> Mobile drafts stay on the device until synchronization. AI analysis uses available inference connectivity.</p>
        <p><strong>Evidence stays accountable.</strong> PostgreSQL is authoritative. Search indexes and caches are derived. Tools retain access checks and approvals; signals require human review.</p>
        <p><strong>Language &amp; guidance.</strong> Translation quality requires language review. Dynamic UI guidance integration is in progress. Local Llama reasoning is optional.</p>
    </div>
    <details class="platform-flow__connections">
        <summary>Read all connections</summary>
        <ul>@foreach (var edge in Edges) { <li>@ConnectionLabel(edge)</li> }</ul>
    </details>
    <p class="platform-flow__note" id="platform-flow-note">Illustrated service relationships, not live traffic or a service-health display. Dashed paths indicate optional reasoning or synchronization.</p>
</section>

